{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的超大白字引文首先吸引视线，薄荷绿高亮的“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”和“沉默也很舒服”最突出；下方另一块大字随后争夺注意。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"两个人正处于亲近、安静相处的时刻，他暂时不想考虑未来，只想享受当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、安静；是否同时有犹豫和心思渐渐飘远，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想表达自己有多喜欢这种相处，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，却没想好怎么开口；舒适亲近之中还藏着心思漂远的转折。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方大字引文较长，一块里包含亲近、舒适、声音退远、心思漂远等多层意思。\",\n    \"上下两块大字都很醒目，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块里：上方讲亲近和舒适，下方讲喜欢、想确认又没开口，需要拼接才能理解完整处境。\",\n    \"中间三行较小文字连续堆叠，包含额外的声音和思绪变化信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1fc31861-7f22-42f8-8a1d-307db3e55326", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011636354465Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:17:25.644805+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "470c98144f20331770006121d85269e0c9bd666e09e3fa4e28a6caf68289caba", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4a